cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Which Hour Does a Fund Price? Pre-analysis plan, code and archived data"
message: "If you use this code or the archived data, please cite it as below."
type: software
abstract: >-
  Pre-analysis plan, analysis code and archived raw downloads for a study of
  the hour at which foreign-equity mutual funds on Türkiye's fund platform are
  valued, and of what that hour implies for evaluating forecasting systems
  scored against such prices. Public data only.
keywords:
  - mutual funds
  - non-synchronous pricing
  - valuation time
  - pre-registration
  - forecast evaluation
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-24"
authors:
  - family-names: Ciftler
    given-names: Abdullah Faruk
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-9310-3812"
repository-code: "https://github.com/farukciftler/fund-valuation-hour"
